"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 13, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 13, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "Waterxfight\n", "textStyle": {"backgroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.92941177, "green": 0.65882355, "red": 0.8509804}}}, "bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 39, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 39, "startIndex": 13, "textRun": {"content": "Qu’est ce que Waterxfight\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 13}, {"endIndex": 579, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 194, "startIndex": 39, "textRun": {"content": "Le Waterfight est une séance de boxe encadrée par des coachs professionnels qui se déroule en piscine pendant 45 minutes dont les mouvements sont inspirés ", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 238, "startIndex": 194, "textRun": {"content": "des arts martiaux et des techniques de boxe.", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 548, "startIndex": 238, "textRun": {"content": " Il se pratique avec des gants de boxe spécifiques afin de mieux travailler avec la résistance de l’eau et tout cela en musique. Grâce à la résistance de l’eau, les coups sont ralentis, l’eau préserve des impacts et des secousses sur l’organisme et les  articulations. Elle ne comporte aucun risque de blessure", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 578, "startIndex": 548, "textRun": {"content": ", car l’eau amortit les chocs.", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.2, "green": 0.2, "red": 0.2}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 579, "startIndex": 578, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 39}, {"endIndex": 580, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 580, "startIndex": 579, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 579}, {"endIndex": 639, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 639, "startIndex": 580, "textRun": {"content": "Il suffit de se munir d’un maillot et d’un bonnet de bain.\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 580}, {"endIndex": 664, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 664, "startIndex": 639, "textRun": {"content": "Bienfaits de Waterxfight\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "headingId": "h.9m5hkv2e455p", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2", "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 4, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 639}, {"endIndex": 700, "paragraph": {"bullet": {"listId": "kix.xib7cv5rvm1f", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}, "elements": [{"endIndex": 700, "startIndex": 664, "textRun": {"content": "évacuer le stress et les tensions ;\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "indentFirstLine": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "indentStart": {"magnitude": 36, "unit": "PT"}, "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 664}, {"endIndex": 754, "paragraph": {"bullet": {"listId": "kix.xib7cv5rvm1f", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}, "elements": [{"endIndex": 754, "startIndex": 700, "textRun": {"content": "développer et renforcer les capacités respiratoires ;\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "indentFirstLi